cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Awesome Agent Memory"
message: "If you use this list in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Amrouche"
    given-names: "Faycal"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Faycall1l/awesome-agent-memory"
url: "https://github.com/Faycall1l/awesome-agent-memory"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A curated list of papers, systems, benchmarks, tools and articles on memory for
  AI agents: persistent state outside the model weights that an agent writes,
  manages and reads across tasks or sessions. Entries are organised by form and
  function of memory, from surveys and foundational systems to graph and temporal
  stores, consolidation and forgetting, procedural memory and skills, evaluation
  and open-source frameworks.
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - long-term memory
  - large language models
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - memory consolidation
  - forgetting
  - procedural memory
  - agent skills
  - knowledge graphs
  - benchmarks
